  <h2>4. Security Architecture & Compliance Report</h2>
  <div class="security-card">
    <h3>Security Measures Implemented:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Authentication Standard:</strong> OAuth2 JSON Web Token (JWT) using HS256 signature algorithm and 7-day expiration windows.</li>
      <li><strong>Cryptographic Hashing:</strong> Passwords hashed using PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 with 100,000 iterations and dedicated salt key (resistant to rainbow table attacks).</li>
      <li><strong>Role-Based Access Control (RBAC):</strong> Enforced at both FastAPI dependency levels (backend) and React Router protected route wrappers (frontend).</li>
      <li><strong>CORS & Origin Security:</strong> Configured middleware headers preventing cross-site scripting (XSS) and request forgery.</li>
      <li><strong>Input Validation:</strong> Strict Pydantic model validation on all incoming payload bodies.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2>5. Core Technology Stack Summary</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Layer</th>
        <th>Technologies Used</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
